st":null,"discountRate":"1","currencyPrice":0.0810,"currencySymbol":"$","isForeignDiscount":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20260902_EPSON-Q13FC13500004_C32346_front.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20260902_EPSON-Q13FC13500004_C32346_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20260902_EPSON-Q13FC13500004_C32346_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/1b4950aa20f416ecba5c6ca916ddd694.svg?t=1731072006","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/9a8f1619bfc64a44992219e8fb24b1dd.svg?t=1731072006"},"faqs":[{"question":"What are the core electrical and physical specifications of the EPSON Q13FC13500004 crystal?","answer":"The EPSON Q13FC13500004 is a 32.768 kHz crystal unit in Epson's FC-135 series. It has a nominal load capacitance of 12.5 pF, a frequency tolerance of ±20 ppm at +25°C (measured at a 0.1 µW drive level), and an operating temperature range of -40°C to +85°C. The crystal has external dimensions of 3.2 ±0.1 mm × 1.5 ±0.1 mm × 0.8 ±0.1 mm, a maximum drive level of 0.5 µW, a maximum motional resistance of 70 kΩ, and a first-year frequency aging specification of ±3 ppm at +25°C."},{"question":"What types of circuits is the EPSON Q13FC13500004 designed for?","answer":"The Q13FC13500004 is a 32.768 kHz crystal unit designed to pair with oscillator circuits built for a 12.5 pF load capacitance and a drive level of 0.1 µW typical (0.5 µW maximum). Designers should confirm their oscillator or RTC circuit is specified for these values before use."},{"question":"What are the temperature and frequency stability characteristics of the EPSON Q13FC13500004?","answer":"The crystal is specified for operation from -40°C to +85°C. Its frequency tolerance is ±20 ppm at +25°C, with a turnover temperature of 25°C (typical) and a parabolic coefficient of -0.04 × 10⁻⁶/°C². The specified first-year frequency aging is ±3 ppm at +25°C, and the maximum drive level is 0.5 µW."},{"question":"What should designers consider when using the EPSON Q13FC13500004 in an oscillator circuit?","answer":"The datasheet specifies a 12.5 pF load capacitance, a maximum drive level of 0.5 µW, and provides a recommended PCB footprint for the device. The oscillator circuit should be designed within these limits."},{"question":"What applications is the EPSON Q13FC13500004 suitable for?","answer":"The EPSON Q13FC13500004 is a 32.768 kHz crystal unit rated for -40°C to +85°C operation, with a first-year frequency aging of ±3 ppm at +25°C and a frequency tolerance of ±20 ppm at +25°C. Suitability for a particular application depends on whether these frequency, stability, and temperature characteristics meet the requirements of the target design."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/d4d1bd2e87b2e72a8e8e7fe7d590f4c0.pdf?productCode=C32346","authenticationList":["ROHS 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1591637","fileName":"FC-135型号适用_ROHS认证(英文版)_EPSON(爱普生).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/72a1a2ccc7145ac74ed4022e8c7ced4f.pdf"}],"productDescEn":"Crystal 32.768kHz ±20ppm 12.5pF 70kΩ SMD3215-2P","productIntroEn":"Crystal 32.768kHz ±20ppm 12.5pF 70kΩ SMD3215-2P","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10915_s","paramName":"工作温度","paramNameEn":"Operating Temperature","paramValue":"-40℃~+85℃","paramValueEn":"-40℃~+85℃","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":false,"sortNumber":1,"sort":6},{"paramCode":"param_11376_n","paramName":"负载电容","paramNameEn":"Load Capacitance","paramValue":"12.5pF","paramValueEn":"12.5pF","paramValueEnForSearch":12.5,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":10},{"paramCode":"param_10912_s","paramName":"常温频差","paramNameEn":"Normal temperature Frequency Tolerance","paramValue":"±20ppm","paramValueEn":"±20ppm","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":2},{"paramCode":"param_11377_n","paramName":"等效串联电阻(ESR)","paramNameEn":"Equivalent Seri